    {"id": "g-034", "why": "End: expiry is in the table only. A connection outlives its Grant, and the cause that ends the holder closes it later",
     "steps": [
       {"op": "put", "t": 0, "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "ep": "A", "acct": "a", "d": {"kind": 1, "loc": 2}, "expect": "ok"},
       {"op": "open", "id": "c1", "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "width": "exact", "expect": "charged:a/A"},
       {"op": "state", "t": 14399, "expect": "x.test 192.0.2.10 kind=1 loc=2 holders=A | conns c1:a/A"},
       {"op": "state", "t": 14400, "expect": "- | conns c1:a/A"},
       {"op": "lookup", "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "width": "exact", "expect": "none"},
       {"op": "end", "cause": "hard_disabled", "ep": "A", "expect": "closed=c1"}
     ]},
    {"id": "g-035", "why": "Put: a deciding query renews the holder for another four hours; a forwarded copy renews the life and decides nothing here",
     "steps": [
       {"op": "put", "t": 0, "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "ep": "A", "acct": "a", "d": {"kind": 1, "loc": 2}, "expect": "ok"},
       {"op": "put", "t": 10000, "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "ep": "A", "acct": "a", "d": {"kind": 1, "loc": 2}, "expect": "ok"},
       {"op": "state", "t": 20000, "expect": "x.test 192.0.2.10 kind=1 loc=2 holders=A"},
       {"op": "state", "t": 24400, "expect": "-"}
     ]},
    {"id": "g-036", "why": "Put: with only this Endpoint and client holding, a newer decision replaces the outcome and closes nothing; with a pick inside the set it is still a replacement",
     "steps": [
       {"op": "put", "t": 0, "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "ep": "A", "acct": "a", "d": {"kind": 1, "pick": "auto", "loc": 1, "eff": [1, 2]}, "expect": "ok"},
       {"op": "open", "id": "c1", "name": "x.test", "src": "192.0.2.10", "width": "exact", "expect": "charged:a/A"},
